{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "sog_carpet",
  "version": "${version}",
  "name": "carpet-SOG-addition",
  "description": "carpet-SOG-addition（SOG）是 Carpet 的附属模组，按方面扩展原版的生存与生电能力：世界与方块机制的开关、发射器用途扩展、合成与耐久的放宽、生物与 Boss 行为调整、信标自定义、一整套可视化（含调控面板与逐玩家渲染清单）、以及若干客户端工具。所有规则默认关闭，可用 /carpet 逐条开关并随 carpet.conf 持久化，单机与专用服务器表现一致；可视化规则用 Ctrl+O 总开关、Ctrl+V 调控面板（OP 还能在面板里把规则切成关闭/暂时开启/永久开启）；本模组自带的配方带有解锁进度，原版配方书与 EasierCrafting 等配方书模组都能检索到。本版本面向 Minecraft 1.21.6：没有长矛，“简易珍珠远距传送”改用木铲/石铲/铁铲分别沿 X/Y/Z 轴推珍珠；嘎吱之心可视化按原设计提供（1.21.4 原版已有嘎吱之心），并做了心跳脉动、到期闪烁、距离裁剪与零分配快照优化。本模组由 AI 制作，作者：WuLi_oi。GitHub：https://github.com/p30qk/Carpet-Addition-SOG",
  "license": "MIT",
  "authors": [
    "WuLi_oi"
  ],
  "contact": {
    "homepage": "https://github.com/p30qk/Carpet-Addition-SOG",
    "sources": "https://github.com/p30qk/Carpet-Addition-SOG",
    "issues": "https://github.com/p30qk/Carpet-Addition-SOG/issues"
  },
  "icon": "assets/sog_carpet/icon.png",
  "environment": "*",
  "entrypoints": {
    "main": [
      "cn.blockforge.generated.sogcarpet.GeneratedMod"
    ],
    "client": [
      "cn.blockforge.generated.sogcarpet.client.SogCarpetClient"
    ]
  },
  "mixins": [
    "sog_carpet.mixins.json",
    {
      "config": "sog_carpet.client.mixins.json",
      "environment": "client"
    },
    {
      "config": "sog_carpet.gca.mixins.json",
      "environment": "*"
    },
    {
      "config": "sog_carpet.ift.mixins.json",
      "environment": "*"
    },
    {
      "config": "sog_carpet.tweakeroo.mixins.json",
      "environment": "client"
    }
  ],
  "depends": {
    "fabricloader": ">=0.19.3",
    "minecraft": ">=1.21.6 <1.21.7",
    "java": ">=21",
    "fabric-api": "*",
    "carpet": ">=1.4.176"
  },
  "recommends": {
    "gca": "*"
  },
  "suggests": {
    "tweakeroo": "*"
  }
}
